OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to stop HGV 'short-cut'
OL,4,Athrough town
OL,5,
OL,6,FHenley and Thame MP, Freddie van
OL,7,FMierlo, said the town had been looking
OL,8,Ffor a solution to the problem for "far
OL,9,Ftoo long" and "we are now further along
OL,10,Fin the process than we've ever been".
